# PulseClass Client Environment Configuration Template
# In production, set these in your hosting provider's dashboard (e.g. Vercel, Render).
# In local development, you do NOT need this file because Vite dev server proxies /api and /socket.io to localhost:5000 automatically.

# Backend API URL (without trailing slash)
# Example: https://pulseclass-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=https://pulseclass-backend.onrender.com

# Backend Socket.io URL (defaults to VITE_API_URL if omitted)
# Example: https://pulseclass-api.onrender.com
VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://pulseclass-backend.onrender.com
